{"id":"dbcfdd3e-18e6-4497-a927-5668a6523571","createdAt":"2026-10-26T15:48:11.467Z","batchId":"onboarding_claude-haiku-5-5_medium","approach":"html","modelId":"claude-haiku-5-5","settings":{"effort":"medium"},"presetId":"onboarding","prompt":"A three-step onboarding wizard: account, preferences, done. Show the current step and next/back buttons.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <h1>Welcome to Northwind</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Set up your account in three quick steps. You can change any of these later in Settings.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row gap-sm\" id=\"wizard-steps\" aria-label=\"Onboarding progress\">\n    <span class=\"badge\" data-step-badge=\"1\">1. Account</span>\n    <span class=\"badge badge-outline\" data-step-badge=\"2\">2. Preferences</span>\n    <span class=\"badge badge-outline\" data-step-badge=\"3\">3. Done</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"progress\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div id=\"wizard-progress\" style=\"width:33%\"></div></div>\n\n  <div class=\"card stack gap-lg\" id=\"wizard\">\n\n    <section class=\"stack gap-lg\" data-step=\"1\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Step 1 of 3</p>\n        <h2>Create your account</h2>\n        <p class=\"muted\">We use this information to identify your workspace and send account notifications.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"alert alert-destructive\" id=\"account-error\" hidden>\n        <strong>Please fix the highlighted fields.</strong> Full name and a valid work email are required.\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"grid cols-2 gap-lg\">\n        <label>Full name\n          <input type=\"text\" id=\"full-name\" placeholder=\"Ada Lovelace\" autocomplete=\"name\">\n        </label>\n        <label>Work email\n          <input type=\"email\" id=\"work-email\" placeholder=\"ada@company.com\" autocomplete=\"email\">\n        </label>\n        <label>Company\n          <input type=\"text\" id=\"company\" placeholder=\"Acme Ltd\" autocomplete=\"organization\">\n        </label>\n        <label>Role\n          <select id=\"role\">\n            <option value=\"\">Select a role</option>\n            <option>Founder</option>\n            <option>Engineering</option>\n            <option>Product</option>\n            <option>Design</option>\n            <option>Operations</option>\n            <option>Other</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">Your email is used for sign-in. You can add teammates after setup.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"stack gap-lg\" data-step=\"2\" hidden>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Step 2 of 3</p>\n        <h2>Set your preferences</h2>\n        <p class=\"muted\">Choose how Northwind should work for you day to day.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"grid cols-2 gap-lg\">\n        <label>Time zone\n          <select id=\"timezone\">\n            <option>UTC+00:00 London</option>\n            <option selected>UTC-05:00 New York</option>\n            <option>UTC-08:00 Los Angeles</option>\n            <option>UTC+01:00 Berlin</option>\n            <option>UTC+09:00 Tokyo</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n        <label>Default currency\n          <select id=\"currency\">\n            <option selected>USD</option>\n            <option>EUR</option>\n            <option>GBP</option>\n            <option>JPY</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <h4>Notifications</h4>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Weekly summary email</label>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Alerts when a project changes status</label>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Product news and tips</label>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <h4>Dashboard view</h4>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"view\" checked> Overview (recommended)</label>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"view\"> Compact list</label>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"view\"> Calendar</label>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"stack gap-lg\" data-step=\"3\" hidden>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Step 3 of 3</p>\n        <h2>You're all set</h2>\n        <p class=\"muted\">Review your choices below. Select Back to change anything before you finish.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <table>\n        <thead>\n          <tr><th>Setting</th><th>Value</th></tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td>Full name</td><td id=\"sum-name\">-</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Work email</td><td id=\"sum-email\">-</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Company</td><td id=\"sum-company\">-</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Role</td><td id=\"sum-role\">-</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Time zone</td><td id=\"sum-tz\">-</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Currency</td><td id=\"sum-currency\">-</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n\n      <div class=\"alert\">\n        <strong>Next up:</strong> invite your team from the Members page. It takes about two minutes.\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"between gap-sm\" id=\"wizard-nav\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-outline\" id=\"btn-back\" hidden>Back</button>\n      <span></span>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\" id=\"btn-skip\">Skip for now</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" id=\"btn-next\">Continue</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"small muted\" id=\"done-note\" hidden>Setup complete. You can revisit these steps anytime from Settings &rarr; Profile.</p>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var current = 1;\n  var total = 3;\n  var sections = document.querySelectorAll('#wizard [data-step]');\n  var badges = document.querySelectorAll('[data-step-badge]');\n  var bar = document.getElementById('wizard-progress');\n  var back = document.getElementById('btn-back');\n  var next = document.getElementById('btn-next');\n  var skip = document.getElementById('btn-skip');\n  var nav = document.getElementById('wizard-nav');\n  var err = document.getElementById('account-error');\n  var doneNote = document.getElementById('done-note');\n\n  function val(id) { return document.getElementById(id).value.trim(); }\n\n  function validateAccount() {\n    var name = val('full-name');\n    var email = val('work-email');\n    var ok = name.length > 0 && /^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$/.test(email);\n    err.hidden = ok;\n    document.getElementById('full-name').setAttribute('aria-invalid', name ? 'false' : 'true');\n    document.getElementById('work-email').setAttribute('aria-invalid', /^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$/.test(email) ? 'false' : 'true');\n    return ok;\n  }\n\n  function fillSummary() {\n    var roleSel = document.getElementById('role');\n    var tzSel = document.getElementById('timezone');\n    var curSel = document.getElementById('currency');\n    document.getElementById('sum-name').textContent = val('full-name') || '-';\n    document.getElementById('sum-email').textContent = val('work-email') || '-';\n    document.getElementById('sum-company').textContent = val('company') || 'Not provided';\n    document.getElementById('sum-role').textContent = roleSel.value || 'Not selected';\n    document.getElementById('sum-tz').textContent = tzSel.options[tzSel.selectedIndex].text;\n    document.getElementById('sum-currency').textContent = curSel.value;\n  }\n\n  function render() {\n    sections.forEach(function (s) {\n      s.hidden = Number(s.getAttribute('data-step')) !== current;\n    });\n    badges.forEach(function (b) {\n      var n = Number(b.getAttribute('data-step-badge'));\n      b.className = n === current ? 'badge' : (n < current ? 'badge badge-secondary' : 'badge badge-outline');\n      b.setAttribute('aria-current', n === current ? 'step' : 'false');\n    });\n    bar.style.width = Math.round((current / total) * 100) + '%';\n    back.hidden = current === 1 || current === total;\n    skip.hidden = current !== 2;\n    nav.hidden = false;\n    if (current === 1) next.textContent = 'Continue';\n    if (current === 2) next.textContent = 'Review';\n    if (current === 3) { next.textContent = 'Finish setup'; fillSummary(); }\n    doneNote.hidden = true;\n    if (current === 3) { /* keep summary visible */ }\n    var heading = document.querySelector('#wizard [data-step]:not([hidden]) h2');\n    if (heading) heading.setAttribute('tabindex', '-1');\n  }\n\n  next.addEventListener('click', function () {\n    if (current === 1 && !validateAccount()) {\n      document.getElementById('full-name').focus();\n      return;\n    }\n    if (current < total) {\n      current++;\n      render();\n    } else {\n      document.getElementById('wizard').hidden = true;\n      document.getElementById('wizard-steps').hidden = true;\n      document.querySelector('.progress').hidden = true;\n      doneNote.hidden = false;\n      var doneCard = document.createElement('div');\n      doneCard.className = 'alert';\n      doneCard.innerHTML = '<strong>Your workspace is ready.</strong> Welcome aboard, ' +\n        (val('full-name') ? val('full-name').split(' ')[0] : 'there') + '.';\n      doneNote.parentNode.insertBefore(doneCard, doneNote);\n      next.disabled = true;\n    }\n  });\n\n  back.addEventListener('click', function () {\n    if (current > 1) { current--; render(); }\n  });\n\n  skip.addEventListener('click', function () {\n    current = 3;\n    render();\n  });\n\n  render();\n})();\n</script>","deltas":[[4058,"<div class=\"page"],[4058," st"],[4058,"ack g"],[4058,"ap-lg\">\n  <"],[4059,"div class=\"stack gap-"],[4059,"sm\">\n    <h1"],[4059,">Welcome to"],[4059," North"],[4059,"w"],[4059,"ind</h1>\n    <"],[4059,"p class=\"lead\">Set"],[4059," up your account in three qu"],[4059,"ick steps. You"],[4059," can change any"],[4059," of these later"],[4059," in"],[4059," Settings.</p>\n  "],[4063,"</div>\n\n  <div class"],[4063,"=\"row g"],[4063,"ap-sm\" id=\"w"],[4063,"izard-steps\" aria"],[4063,"-label=\"On"],[4063,"boarding progress\">\n    "],[4063,"<span"],[4063," class=\"badge\" data-step"],[4063,"-"],[4063,"bad"],[4063,"ge=\"1\">1"],[4063,". Account</span>\n    "],[4063,"<span class=\"badge badge"],[4063,"-out"],[4063,"line\" data-step-badge"],[4063,"=\"2\">2. Prefer"],[4063,"ences</span>\n    <span"],[4063," class=\"badge badge-out"],[4063,"line\" data-step-badge"],[4063,"=\"3\">3. Done</"],[4063,"span>\n  </div>"],[4063,"\n\n  <div class=\"progress\""],[4063," aria-h"],[4063,"idden=\"true\""],[4063,"><div id"],[4063,"=\"w"],[4063,"izard-progress\" style=\""],[4063,"width:33%\"></div></"],[4063,"div>\n\n  <div class=\""],[4063,"card st"],[4063,"ack g"],[4063,"ap-lg\" id=\"w"],[4063,"izard\">"],[4063,"\n\n    <section"],[4063," class"],[4063,"=\"stack g"],[4063,"ap-lg\" data-step"],[4063,"=\"1\">"],[4063,"\n      <div class=\"stack"],[4063," g"],[4063,"ap-sm\">\n        <"],[4063,"p class=\"small"],[4063," mu"],[4063,"ted\">Step 1 of"],[4063," 3</p>\n        <"],[4063,"h2>Create your account</"],[4063,"h2>\n        <p class"],[4063,"=\"muted\">We use"],[4063," this information"],[4063," to ident"],[4063,"ify your"],[4063," workspace and send"],[4063," account"],[4063," notifications.</p>"],[4063,"\n      </div>\n\n      <div"],[4063," class=\"al"],[4063,"e